<div style="margin: 32px 0;width:100%;padding:0;" id="main-content">
<h1 align="center" style="font-weight: 600!important; color:#1e376c;">Camden County College</h1>
<div class="row" style="max-width:1160px;margin: 0 auto;">
<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6" style="max-width:600px;height:260px;padding-right:16px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
<div style="height:100%; background-image:url('https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/uploads/five-easy-steps-panel.jpg'); background-color:#ffffff; background-size: cover; background-position: left; background-repeat: no-repeat; overflow: hidden; padding:16px;">
<div align="center" class="font-white" style="max-width: 275px; float: right;">
<h2 style="font: 28px/1.25em 'Fira Sans', sans-serif;text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px #222222;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom: 10px;">5 Steps<br /> to Enroll</h2>
<p role="doc-subtitle">A step by step guide from application to course registration</p>
<p>        <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/admissions-financial-aid/how-to-apply/" id="HPT-how-to-enroll" class="blue-gray-button trgr-how-to-enroll" role="button">get started</a>
    </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6" style="max-width:600px;height:260px;padding-left:16px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
<div style="height:100%; background-image:url('https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/uploads/Financial-Aid-and-Payment-Plans-panel.jpg'); background-color:#ffffff; background-size: cover; background-position: left; background-repeat: no-repeat; overflow: hidden; padding:16px; /*temp til flex*/ ">
<div align="center" class="font-white" style="max-width: 275px; float: right;">
<h2 style="font: 28px/1.25em 'Fira Sans', sans-serif;text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px #222222;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom: 10px;">Financial Aid &amp;<br /> Payment Plans</h2>
<p role="doc-subtitle">Identify grants, scholarships, and financial resourses</p>
<p>                <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/admissions-financial-aid/financial-aid/paying-for-college/" id="hpt-financial-aid" class="blue-gray-button trgr-finanacial-aid" role="button">MORE INFO</a>
           </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
<div class="row" style="max-width:1160px;margin: 0 auto;">
<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6" style="max-width:600px;height:260px;padding-left:16px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
<div style="height:100%; background-image:url('https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/uploads/how-can-we-help-you-panel.jpg'); background-color:#ffffff; background-size: cover; background-position: left; background-repeat: no-repeat; overflow: hidden; padding:16px;">
<div align="center" class="font-white" style="max-width: 275px; float: right;">
<h2 style="font: 28px/1.25em 'Fira Sans', sans-serif;text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px #222222;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom: 10px;">Student Services<br />Information</h2>
<p role="doc-subtitle">Contact emails, phone numbers<br />and office locations</p>
<p>                <a href="/student-services-information/" id="hpt-student-services" class="blue-gray-button trgr-student-services" role="button">SEE OPTIONS</a>
            </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6" style="max-width:600px;height:260px;padding-left:16px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
<div style="height:100%; background-image:url('https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/uploads/academic-programs-panel.jpg');background-color:#ffffff; background-size: cover; background-position: left; background-repeat: no-repeat; overflow: hidden; padding:16px; /*temp til flex*/ ">
<div align="center" class="font-white" style="max-width: 300px; float: right;">
<h2 style="font: 28px/1.25em 'Fira Sans', sans-serif;text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px #222222;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom: 10px;">Academic<br />Programs</h2>
<p role="doc-subtitle">100+ degree and certificate programs to achieve your academic goals
            </p>
<p>            <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/academics-1/programs-of-study/" id="hpt-academic-programs" class="blue-gray-button trgr-programs-of-study" role="button">VIEW PROGRAMS</a>
        </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
<div class="row" style="max-width:1160px;margin: 0 auto;">
<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6" style="max-width:600px;height:260px;padding-left:16px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
<div style="height:100%; background-image:url('https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/uploads/workforce-training-panel.jpg'); background-color:#ffffff; background-size: cover; background-position: left; background-repeat: no-repeat; overflow: hidden; padding:16px; /*temp til flex*/ ">
<div align="center" class="font-white" style="max-width: 275px; float: right;">
<h2 style="font: 28px/1.25em 'Fira Sans', sans-serif;text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px #222222;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom: 10px;">Workforce Training &#038; Continuing Education</h2>
<p role="doc-subtitle">Your pathway to a<br />
rewarding career
            </p>
<p>            <a href="/ce/" class="blue-gray-button trgr-ce" id="hpt-safety" role="button">LEARN MORE</a>
        </div>
</p></div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6" style="max-width:600px;height:260px;padding-left:16px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
<div style="height:100%; background-image:url('https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/uploads/online-education-panel.jpg'); background-color:#ffffff; background-size: 600px 260px; background-position: left; background-repeat: no-repeat; overflow: hidden; padding:16px; /*temp til flex*/ ">
<div align="center" class="font-white" style="max-width: 275px; float: right;">
<h2 style="font: 28px/1.25em 'Fira Sans', sans-serif;text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px #222222;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom: 10px;">Online Education<br /> Made Easy</h2>
<p role="doc-subtitle">See how we’re delivering advanced digital instruction</p>
<p>                    <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/transition-to-online-learning/" id="hpt-online-learning" class="blue-gray-button trgr-online-education" role="button">LEARN MORE</a>
               </div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<p><a id="eventsandnews"></a></p>
